  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges.\n• Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Cut red onion into thin wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6db55e63de86f300272f/step-d4c8cf6a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend and season with salt. Toss to coat, then set aside.\n• Place carrot and onion on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with ras el hanout and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast veggies until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6db55e63de86f300272f/step-0798dae5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a medium saucepan over medium heat with half the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook half the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt. Stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat. Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6db55e63de86f300272f/step-6cdda5db.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, place remaining garlic and butter in a medium heatproof bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts until fragrant.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes and mash to combine. Stir in Greek-style yoghurt.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6db55e63de86f300272f/step-cc87cffa.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir baby spinach leaves and roasted carrot and onion through the garlic rice.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6db55e63de86f300272f/step-bcff2da7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drizzle the honey over roasted pumpkin.\n• Divide roast veggie rice toss between plates. Top with Moroccan-style pumpkin and haloumi.\n• Dollop over garlic-fetta yoghurt. Sprinkle with pepitas to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6db55e63de86f300272f/step-da285104.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
